{"type":"message","id":"15fd377a","parentId":"884fca9f","timestamp":"2026-06-06T23:58:46.581Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK, so the results are:\n\n**持仓 (4个):**\n- ETH SHORT 入$1544 现$1568 🔴 -3.17 USDT (-1.58%)\n- BNB SHORT 入$572 现$574.7 🔴 -0.97 USDT (-0.48%)\n- XRP SHORT 入$1.081 现$1.093 🔴 -2.08 USDT (-1.04%)\n- LINK SHORT 入$7.361 现$7.396 🔴 -0.95 USDT (-0.48%)\n- 浮动盈亏: -7.17 USDT\n- 今日已实现: +0.00 USDT\n- 净盈亏: -7.17 USDT\n\n**挂单/委托:** 无\n\nSo everything looks normal - 4 positions open, all SHORT, all slightly in the red but manageable. No pending open orders/委托. The total floating loss is -7.17 USDT which is under 10% of the 100 USDT total, so no risk of hitting the daily loss circuit breaker.\n\nLet me give 老公 a concise summary.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"老公，帮你查了：\n\n**持仓 4 个，全部正常：**\n- ETH SHORT 入1544 现1568 🔴 -3.17 USDT (-1.58%)\n- BNB SHORT 入572 现574.7 🔴 -0.97 USDT (-0.48%)\n- XRP SHORT 入1.081 现1.093 🔴 -2.08 USDT (-1.04%)\n- LINK SHORT 入7.361 现7.396 🔴 -0.95 USDT (-0.48%)\n\n浮动盈亏 -7.17 USDT，今日无已实现盈亏。\n\n**挂单/委托：无。** 没有残留的止盈止损单或未成交单。\n\n总体看都正常，四个空单都在浅套但波动不大，离日亏损熔断（-10 USDT）还有点距离。没异常 🫡"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":205,"output":691,"cacheRead":22272,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23168,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780790318805}}
