{"type":"message","id":"0226bf14","parentId":"ab73c6fe","timestamp":"2026-06-07T00:42:13.149Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking whether each position has corresponding take-profit and stop-loss orders. Let me check this by looking at the open orders again - but actually, the open orders came back as 0. So currently there are NO TP/SL orders placed for the positions.\n\nLet me also check if the positions themselves have stop-loss or take-profit built in (position information from Binance might include this). Actually, on Binance Futures, TP/SL are placed as separate orders, not embedded in the position itself.\n\nSo the answer is: no, currently there are 0 open orders, meaning none of the 4 positions have active take-profit or stop-loss orders.\n\nLet me also check if the query_positions.py shows any TP/SL info.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_fzMZ62QkHDLSUf33f6vT1224","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport json, time, hmac, hashlib, requests, sys\nsys.path.insert(0, '.')\nimport binance_auto_trade as bat\n\ncfg = bat._load_config_if_changed()['binance_api']\napi_key = cfg['api_key']\nsecret_key = cfg['secret_key']\n\n# 查所有挂单（止盈止损单属于 STOP_MARKET 类型）\ntimestamp = int(time.time() * 1000)\nquery_string = f'timestamp={timestamp}'\nsignature = hmac.new(secret_key.encode(), query_string.encode(), hashlib.sha256).hexdigest()\nheaders = {'X-MBX-APIKEY': api_key}\n\n# 1. 所有 open orders\nurl = f'{bat.BASE_URL}/fapi/v1/openOrders?{query_string}&signature={signature}'\nr = requests.get(url, headers=headers, timeout=15, verify=False)\norders = r.json()\n\nprint('=== 挂单（含止盈止损）===')\n\n# 2. 查仓位信息（看是否有自带的 TP/SL 属性）\nurl2 = f'{bat.BASE_URL}/fapi/v2/positionRisk?{query_string}&signature={signature}'\nr2 = requests.get(url2, headers=headers, timeout=15, verify=False)\npositions_raw = r2.json()\n\nfor p in positions_raw:\n    amt = float(p.get('positionAmt', 0))\n    if amt == 0:\n        continue\n    # 检查是否有对应挂单\n    pos_orders = [o for o in orders if o['symbol'] == p['symbol']] if isinstance(orders, list) else []\n    tp_count = sum(1 for o in pos_orders if 'TAKE_PROFIT' in o.get('type',''))\n    sl_count = sum(1 for o in pos_orders if 'STOP' in o.get('type','') and 'TAKE_PROFIT' not in o.get('type',''))\n    print(f'{p[\\\"symbol\\\"]}: 仓位{amt} | 止盈委托:{tp_count} | 止损委托:{sl_count}')\n\nif isinstance(orders, list) and len(orders) == 0:\n    print()\n    print('⚠️ 没有任何止盈止损挂单！四个仓位都裸奔中')\n\" 2>&1","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":4434,"output":888,"cacheRead":18688,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24010,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780792921592}}
