{"type":"message","id":"f631d49b","parentId":"f10de8a2","timestamp":"2026-06-07T00:42:27.745Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All 4 positions have no take-profit or stop-loss orders. This is a problem - the positions are \"naked\" (裸奔). According to the SOUL.md, the system should have automatic TP/SL based on the smart TP/SL algorithm. Let me check if the monitor or the auto-trade system should be placing these automatically.\n\nLooking at SOUL.md:\n- 止盈 = min(阻力位, 价格×(1+ATR×1.5×RSI因子), 24h高点)\n- 止损 = max(支撑位×0.995, 价格×(1-ATR×分层倍数), 24h低点×0.98)\n\nAnd the three-tier trailing stop:\n- 第1档: +2% → 锁定 0.8%\n- 第2档: +3% → 锁定 2%\n- 第3档: +4% → 全部平仓\n\nSo the positions should have TP/SL orders. This needs attention. Let me tell 老公 and ask if he wants me to check the monitor or place the orders.\n\nActually, let me first check if the monitor was supposed to place these. Let me check the auto_trade script or monitor for TP/SL logic. But actually the positions are all in the red (short positions losing money since prices went up), so the system might have placed TP/SL initially but they could have been cancelled, or the system never placed them.\n\nLet me just report the facts and ask if he wants me to investigate further or place orders.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"没有，四个仓位全部裸奔 —— 没有一个止盈单也没有一个止损单。\n\n- ETH SHORT：无 TP / 无 SL\n- BNB SHORT：无 TP / 无 SL\n- XRP SHORT：无 TP / 无 SL\n- LINK SHORT：无 TP / 无 SL\n\n这不太正常，按策略开仓后应该自动挂止盈止损的。要我查一下 monitor 日志看是没挂还是被撤了？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":403,"output":747,"cacheRead":23808,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24958,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780792937950}}
