{"type":"message","id":"df051c2f","parentId":"56d6a9a0","timestamp":"2026-06-07T00:43:27.539Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user says they can see 8 orders (delegations) in their Feishu/ exchange interface - one TP and one SL for each of the 4 positions. But my API query returned 0 open orders.\n\nThis could be:\n1. The orders are conditional/stop orders that didn't show up in my query for some reason\n2. The API endpoint I used was wrong\n3. The orders might be in a different state that my query didn't catch\n\nLet me try a different approach - maybe the orders are stop orders that need a different endpoint or query parameter. Let me also try querying all orders (not just open) or check if there's a specific endpoint for conditional orders on Binance Futures.\n\nActually, on Binance Futures, stop-limit and take-profit orders should show up in `/fapi/v1/openOrders`. But maybe the user is seeing them on the exchange UI directly. Let me try to query again more carefully, maybe with a different approach.\n\nLet me also check if maybe the orders are conditional orders that need `/fapi/v1/conditional/openOrder` or similar endpoint.\n\nWait - on Binance Futures, there's a separate endpoint for TP/SL orders! `POST /fapi/v1/order` with `type=TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET` or `type=STOP_MARKET`, and there might be a separate endpoint to list them.\n\nLet me try `/fapi/v1/allOrders` to see all orders including filled/canceled, and also try the specific conditional order endpoints.\n\nActually, let me think again. The Binance Futures API:\n- `/fapi/v1/openOrders` - lists all open limit/market/stop orders\n- STOP and TAKE_PROFIT orders should appear in openOrders\n\nBut maybe my query had an issue. Let me try again with more detail.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_LrlypVjnCsjhSIPqfQt68286","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport json, time, hmac, hashlib, requests, sys\nsys.path.insert(0, '.')\nimport binance_auto_trade as bat\n\ncfg = bat._load_config_if_changed()['binance_api']\napi_key = cfg['api_key']\nsecret_key = cfg['secret_key']\n\ndef signed_get(endpoint):\n    ts = int(time.time() * 1000)\n    qs = f'timestamp={ts}'\n    sig = hmac.new(secret_key.encode(), qs.encode(), hashlib.sha256).hexdigest()\n    url = f'{bat.BASE_URL}{endpoint}?{qs}&signature={sig}'\n    r = requests.get(url, headers={'X-MBX-APIKEY': api_key}, timeout=15, verify=False)\n    return r.json()\n\n# 方式1: 标准 openOrders\norders = signed_get('/fapi/v1/openOrders')\nprint(f'openOrders: {len(orders) if isinstance(orders,list) else orders}')\n\n# 方式2: 所有订单（最近）\nfor sym in ['ETHUSDT','BNBUSDT','XRPUSDT','LINKUSDT']:\n    all_ord = signed_get(f'/fapi/v1/allOrders?symbol={sym}&limit=10')\n    if isinstance(all_ord, list):\n        open_ord = [o for o in all_ord if o['status'] not in ('FILLED','CANCELED','EXPIRED','REJECTED')]\n        print(f'  {sym}: 共{len(all_ord)}单历史, 未完成{len(open_ord)}单')\n        for o in open_ord:\n            print(f'    {o[\\\"type\\\"]} {o[\\\"side\\\"]} 价{o.get(\\\"stopPrice\\\",o.get(\\\"price\\\"))} 状态{o[\\\"status\\\"]}')\n\" 2>&1","timeout":45}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":352,"output":1262,"cacheRead":24576,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26190,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780792993154}}
