{"type":"message","id":"62cb86cd","parentId":"95d00a34","timestamp":"2026-06-07T00:44:38.169Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So according to the Binance API, there are 0 open orders across all 4 symbols. But the user says they can see 8 orders in the 委托 interface.\n\nThis is interesting. There are a few possibilities:\n1. The orders are STOP/TRAILING_STOP type orders that on Binance Futures might need a different endpoint\n2. The API is returning different data than what the user sees on the web interface\n3. There might be a time sync issue\n\nWait - I just realized something. The \"status\" filter might be wrong. On Binance Futures, STOP orders might have a different status than \"NEW\" - they might show as \"NEW\" but the TP/SL orders might be on a different system entirely.\n\nLet me check without the status filter - show all 10 orders regardless of status.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_FMGt6c3R1aGJFMW2HUK68742","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport json, time, hmac, hashlib, requests, sys\nfrom urllib.parse import parse_qs, urlparse, urlencode\n\nimport binance_auto_trade as bat\ncfg = bat._load_config_if_changed()['binance_api']\napi_key = cfg['api_key']\nsecret_key = cfg['secret_key']\n\ndef signed_get(path):\n    ts = int(time.time() * 1000)\n    parsed = urlparse('http://x' + path)\n    params = parse_qs(parsed.query)\n    flat = {k: v[0] for k, v in params.items()}\n    flat['timestamp'] = ts\n    qs = urlencode(sorted(flat.items()))\n    sig = hmac.new(secret_key.encode(), qs.encode(), hashlib.sha256).hexdigest()\n    url = f'{bat.BASE_URL}{parsed.path}?{qs}&signature={sig}'\n    r = requests.get(url, headers={'X-MBX-APIKEY': api_key}, timeout=15, verify=False)\n    return r.json()\n\nfor sym in ['ETHUSDT','BNBUSDT','XRPUSDT','LINKUSDT']:\n    try:\n        data = signed_get(f'/fapi/v1/allOrders?symbol={sym}&limit=5')\n        if isinstance(data, list):\n            print(f'--- {sym} 最近5单 ---')\n            for o in data:\n                print(f'  {o[\\\"type\\\"]:20s} {o[\\\"side\\\"]:5s} 状态:{o[\\\"status\\\"]:10s} stopPrice:{o.get(\\\"stopPrice\\\",\\\"-\\\"):10s} price:{o.get(\\\"price\\\",\\\"-\\\"):10s} 数量:{o[\\\"origQty\\\"]}')\n        else:\n            print(f'{sym}: 异常 {json.dumps(data)[:200]}')\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f'{sym}: {e}')\n\" 2>&1","timeout":45}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":495,"output":848,"cacheRead":29568,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":30911,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780793068653}}
