{"type":"message","id":"08f464c8","parentId":"ee7e0d65","timestamp":"2026-06-07T00:46:04.603Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see the full picture. The Algo orders show `triggerPrice` (not `stopPrice`), and `price` is 0 because they're MARKET orders. Let me get the trigger prices for all of them.\n\nActually, looking at the first one (ETHUSDT STOP):\n- triggerPrice: 1574.88 (this is the stop loss trigger)\n- quantity: 0.130\n\nThe `price` is 0.00 because it's a STOP_MARKET - no limit price, just triggers at the stop price.\n\nLet me get all trigger prices properly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_7ScvHjtlkDei1NyKtyBG9499","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport json, time, hmac, hashlib, requests\nfrom urllib.parse import urlencode\n\nimport binance_auto_trade as bat\ncfg = bat._load_config_if_changed()['binance_api']\napi_key = cfg['api_key']\nsecret_key = cfg['secret_key']\n\nts = int(time.time() * 1000)\nqs = urlencode(sorted({'timestamp': ts}.items()))\nsig = hmac.new(secret_key.encode(), qs.encode(), hashlib.sha256).hexdigest()\nurl = f'{bat.BASE_URL}/fapi/v1/openAlgoOrders?{qs}&signature={sig}'\n\nr = requests.get(url, headers={'X-MBX-APIKEY': api_key}, timeout=15, verify=False)\ndata = r.json()\n\nprint(f'活跃 Algo 委托共 {len(data)} 单：')\nprint()\n\n# 按币种+类型排序\ndata_sorted = sorted(data, key=lambda x: (x['symbol'], 'TAKE_PROFIT' not in x.get('orderType','')))\n\nfor o in data_sorted:\n    sym = o['symbol']\n    otype = o['orderType']\n    tag = '🎯止盈' if 'TAKE_PROFIT' in otype else '🛑止损'\n    trigger = float(o['triggerPrice'])\n    qty = o['quantity']\n    s = o['side']\n    status = o['algoStatus']\n    print(f'{sym} {tag} | {s} {qty}张 | 触发价:{trigger} | 状态:{status}')\n\" 2>&1","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":764,"output":670,"cacheRead":3673