{"type":"message","id":"37672ba4","parentId":"12961392","timestamp":"2026-06-07T02:13:52.005Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The state file doesn't save circuit breaker info, but the `daily_pnl` of -11.49 exceeds the -10% threshold. The circuit breaker is in memory only. \n\nLooking at the monitor code:\n- `is_trading_allowed()` clears paused_until every call (lines 856-857)\n- Then checks daily loss, which will trigger a new pause since -11.49% < -10%\n- Returns False, blocks new trades\n\nSo the monitor IS effectively blocking new trades due to circuit breaker. It just keeps re-triggering every cycle because the forced clear prevents the 4-hour countdown from working.\n\nThe BNB position is still open with SL at 583.4, current price 580.51. That's 0.5% away.\n\nLet me summarize what's happening and tell 老公: monitor IS blocking new positions, but the circuit breaker's timer is broken (cleared every cycle). The BNB position is the only one left and it's hovering near stop loss.\n\nActually, since 老公's instruction on 2026-03-31 said \"清除熔断\" (clear circuit breaker), maybe he doesn't want the circuit breaker at all? But the code still checks daily loss. Let me just report the facts.\n\nLet me be concise: monitor is alive, it's blocking new trades properly, but the 4-hour timer doesn't actually count down because of the clear at line 856. BNB is the last man standing, barely above stop loss.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"monitor 跑着呢，也在干活——日亏 -11.49% 已经触发熔断，不会开新仓。但有个毛病：之前你让\"清除熔断\"那行代码导致 4 小时倒计时不生效，每次检查都清掉重新触发。\n\n说白了就是：不开新仓 ✅，但恢复时间没法正常倒数。\n\n当前只剩 BNB 一个仓位，580.51 挂着，止损 583.4 只差 0.5%。今天就不适合再动了，等市场冷静下。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":167,"output":738,"cacheRead":58240,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":59145,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780798420945}}
