{"type":"message","id":"5ad4e9ef","parentId":"a886ca92","timestamp":"2026-06-07T05:45:31.665Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The klines API is returning nothing. This is probably because the Binance testnet API is not accessible via the proxy or the endpoint is wrong. Let me check the correct endpoint.\n\nActually, looking at the code, `_get_klines` uses `f\"{CONFIG['binance_futures']}/klines\"` which is likely `https://testnet.binancefuture.com/fapi/v1/klines`. Let me try again with the correct path.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_a1ryhajPMeXRMkHVukcQ3481","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport json, requests\nfrom urllib3.exceptions import InsecureRequestWarning\nrequests.packages.urllib3.disable_warnings(InsecureRequestWarning)\n\n# Test direct kline call\nproxies = {'https': 'http://127.0.0.1:7890', 'http': 'http://127.0.0.1:7890'}\nurl = 'https://testnet.binancefuture.com/fapi/v1/klines'\nr = requests.get(url, params={'symbol': 'BTCUSDT', 'interval': '15m', 'limit': 5}, proxies=proxies, verify=False, timeout=15)\nprint(f'Status: {r.status_code}')\nprint(f'Body: {r.text[:500]}')\n\" 2>&1","timeout":20}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":286,"output":440,"cacheRead":66944,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":67670,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780811125969}}
