{"type":"message","id":"273dfd72","parentId":"2a4e735c","timestamp":"2026-06-07T05:45:50.738Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK the API works. The issue was that I was using the wrong base URL. Let me fix my script to use the correct endpoint.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_HNZd8Zxboy0F55HGhnXp3703","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport json, time, requests, numpy as np\nfrom urllib3.exceptions import InsecureRequestWarning\nrequests.packages.urllib3.disable_warnings(InsecureRequestWarning)\n\nSYMBOLS = ['BTC','ETH','SOL','BNB','DOT','LINK','XRP']\nPROXY = {'https': 'http://127.0.0.1:7890', 'http': 'http://127.0.0.1:7890'}\nBASE = 'https://testnet.binancefuture.com/fapi/v1'\n\ns = requests.Session()\ns.proxies = PROXY\ns.verify = False\n\ndef get_klines(sym, interval='15m', limit=100):\n    r = s.get(f'{BASE}/klines', params={'symbol': f'{sym}USDT', 'interval': interval, 'limit': limit}, timeout=15)\n    if r.status_code == 200:\n        data = r.json()\n        closes = [float(k[4]) for k in data]\n        volumes = [float(k[5]) for k in data]\n        return closes, volumes\n    return [], []\n\ndef rsi(closes, period=14):\n    if len(closes) < period+1: return 50.0\n    deltas = np.diff(closes)\n    gain = np.mean(np.where(deltas>0,deltas,0)[-period:])\n    loss = np.mean(np.where(deltas<0,-deltas,0)[-period:])\n    if loss==0: return 100.0\n    return 100-(100/(1+gain/loss))\n\ndef ema(vals, p):\n    if len(vals)<p: return vals[-1] if vals else 0\n    k=2/(p+1); e=vals[0]\n    for v in vals[1:]: e=v*k+e*(1-k)\n    return e\n\nstate = json.load(open('crypto_state.json'))\nprices = state['prices']\nprint(f'📊 日亏 {state[\\\"daily_pnl\\\"]:+.2f}U (-15.7%) | 熔断中 ⚠️')\nprint()\n\nheader = f'{\\\"币种\\\":<5} {\\\"价格\\\":>8} {\\\"RSI\\\":>5} {\\\"方向\\\":>5} {\\\"MS\\\":>3}/{\\\"阈值\\\":>3} {\\\"判断\\\":>4}  {\\\"细节\\\"}'\nprint(header)\nprint('-'*70)\n\nfor sym in SYMBOLS:\n    if sym not in prices: continue\n    price = prices[sym]\n    closes, vols = get_klines(sym)\n    if len(closes)<60:\n        print(f'{sym:<5} K线不足')\n        continue\n    \n    r = rsi(closes)\n    ma60 = sum(closes[-60:])/60\n    chg = (price-closes[-96])/closes[-96]*100 if len(closes)>=96 else 0\n    vc = vols[-1] if vols else 0\n    va = sum(vols[-21:-1])/20 if len(vols)>=21 else vc\n    \n    sc = 0; d = ''\n    parts = []\n    \n    # RSI 35分\n    if r < 35:\n        sc+=35; d='LONG'; parts.append(f'RSI({r:.0f})超卖+35')\n    elif r > 65:\n        sc+=35; d='SHORT'; parts.append(f'RSI({r:.0f})超买+35')\n    else:\n        parts.append(f'RSI({r:.0f})中性')\n    \n    # 24h 25分\n    if chg < -5:\n        sc+=25\n        if not d: d='LONG'\n        parts.append(f'24h跌{chg:.1f}%+25')\n    elif chg > 5:\n        sc+=25\n        if not d: d='SHORT'\n        parts.append(f'24h涨{chg:.1f}%+25')\n    else:\n        parts.append(f'24h{chg:+.1f}%')\n    \n    # MA60 20分\n    if price >= ma60:\n        sc+=20\n        if not d: d='LONG'\n        parts.append(f'>MA60+20')\n    else:\n        if not d: d='SHORT'\n        parts.append(f'<MA60')\n    \n    # 成交量 20分\n    if vc > va:\n        sc+=20\n        parts.append(f'量>均+20')\n    else:\n        parts.append(f'量弱')\n    \n    # 阈值\n    if abs(chg) > 10: thr = 90\n    elif abs(ema(closes,9)-ema(closes,27))/ema(closes,27) > 0.005: thr = 70\n    else: thr = 30\n    \n    ok = '✅' if sc >= thr else '❌'\n    if not d: ok = '➖'\n    \n    print(f'{sym:<5} {price:>8.4g} {r:>5.0f} {d:>5} {sc:>3}/{thr:<3} {ok:>4}  {\\\"  |  \\\".join(parts)}')\n\nprint()\nprint(f'⚠️ 日亏已熔断，不计分数，任何信号都暂不开仓')\n\" 2>&1","timeout":60}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":355,"output":1334,"cacheRead":67456,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":69145,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780811135801}}
{"type":"message","id":"d7c8952f","parentId":"273dfd72","timestamp":"2026-06-07T05:45:57.922Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_HNZd8Zxboy0F55HGhnXp3703","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"📊 日亏 -15.70U (-15.7%) | 熔断中 ⚠️\n\n币种          价格   RSI    方向  MS/ 阈值   判断  细节\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nBTC   6.18e+04    78 SHORT  55/30     ✅  RSI(78)超买+35  |  24h+1.2%  |  >MA60+20  |  量弱\nETH       1606    78 SHORT  55/70     ❌  RSI(78)超买+35  |  24h+2.3%  |  >MA60+20  |  量弱\nSOL      64.38    74 SHORT  55/70     ❌  RSI(74)超买+35  |  24h+2.3%  |  >MA60+20  |  量弱\nBNB      586.8    80 SHORT  55/70     ❌  RSI(80)超买+35  |  24h+1.5%  |  >MA60+20  |  量弱\nDOT      0.966    75 SHORT  55/70     ❌  RSI(75)超买+35  |  24h+3.4%  |  >MA60+20  |  量弱\nLINK     7.626    71 SHORT  55/70     ❌  RSI(71)超买+35  |  24h+4.0%  |  >MA60+20  |  量弱\nXRP      1.122    73 SHORT  55/70     ❌  RSI(73)超买+35  |  24h+2.5%  |  >MA60+20  |  量弱\n\n⚠️ 日亏已熔断，不计分数，任何信号都暂不开仓"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":7125,"aggregated":"📊 日亏 -15.70U (-15.7%) | 熔断中 ⚠️\n\n币种          价格   RSI    方向  MS/ 阈值   判断  细节\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nBTC   6.18e+04    78 SHORT  55/30     ✅  RSI(78)超买+35  |  24h+1.2%  |  >MA60+20  |  量弱\nETH       1606    78 SHORT  55/70     ❌  RSI(78)超买+35  |  24h+2.3%  |  >MA60+20  |  量弱\nSOL      64.38    74 SHORT  55/70     ❌  RSI(74)超买+35  |  24h+2.3%  |  >MA60+20  |  量弱\nBNB      586.8    80 SHORT  55/70     ❌  RSI(80)超买+35  |  24h+1.5%  |  >MA60+20  |  量弱\nDOT      0.966    75 SHORT  55/70     ❌  RSI(75)超买+35  |  24h+3.4%  |  >MA60+20  |  量弱\nLINK     7.626    71 SHORT  55/70     ❌  RSI(71)超买+35  |  24h+4.0%  |  >MA60+20  |  量弱\nXRP      1.122    73 SHORT  55/70     ❌  RSI(73)超买+35  |  24h+2.5%  |  >MA60+20  |  量弱\n\n⚠️ 日亏已熔断，不计分数，任何信号都暂不开仓","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780811157913}}
{"type":"message","id":"8dee4841","parentId":"d7c8952f","timestamp":"2026-06-07T05:46:08.563Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so the full picture:\n\n1. ALL coins are SHORT signals (RSI 71-80 = overbought)\n2. But the market regime is TRENDING (ETH/SOL/BNB/DOT/LINK/XRP all need 70 threshold, not 30)\n3. Only BTC passes the trending threshold (55/30), others fail (55/70)\n4. ALL with weak volume = don't get the volume bonus\n5. Daily PnL = -15.70 USDT = -15.7% = CIRCUIT BREAKER triggered\n\nSo:\n- No positions left (all 4 stopped out)\n- Circuit breaker active (daily loss > 10%)\n- Market is trending up, all coins overbought (RSI 70+)\n- Even without circuit breaker, only BTC would trigger (55/30 in ranging) but its signal is SHORT\n- None of the non-BTC coins pass their trending regime thresholds\n\nThe answer: can't buy anything right now. Circuit breaker is on, and even if it weren't, the signals are mixed at best.\n\nLet me give a clean summary.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"查完了，情况是这样的：\n\n**熔断状态：已触发 ⚠️**\n日亏 -15.70 U（-15.7%），远超 -10% 熔断线，自动锁仓不开新单。\n\n**信号面：**\n所有币种 RSI 都在 70-80 严重超买区，方向都是 SHORT，但除了 BTC 其他都不到开仓阈值：\n\n| 币种 | 评分/阈值 | \n|:---|:---|\n| BTC | 55/30 ✅ | \n| ETH | 55/70 ❌ |\n| SOL | 55/70 ❌ |\n| BNB | 55/70 ❌ |\n| DOT | 55/70 ❌ |\n| LINK | 55/70 ❌ |\n| XRP | 55/70 ❌ |\n\n量能也都不行，全是缩量。\n\n**结论：买不了。** 熔断锁着 + 量能弱 + 除了 BTC 都不达标。今天只能观望，让系统冷却到明天再说。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":556,"output":693,"cacheRead":68992,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":70241,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780811157930}}
