{"type":"message","id":"25a51122","parentId":"fb42344d","timestamp":"2026-06-07T05:50:49.442Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"老公说：把熔断打开（解除熔断），让系统正常开仓，当前主要是拿数据，等稳定之后再启用熔断。\n\n意思就是：暂时关掉熔断机制，让 monitor 可以继续开仓交易，目的是收集数据和测试策略。等以后稳定了再把熔断打开。\n\n那我需要修改 crypto_signal_monitor.py 中的 CircuitBreaker.is_trading_allowed() 方法，让它始终返回 True（允许交易）。\n\n当前代码的问题是在 is_trading_allowed 开头有一行清除熔断的代码（老公之前指示的），但后面仍然会检查日亏损。我需要加一个开关。\n\n最好的做法是加一个配置项或者在 is_trading_allowed 里加一个简单的开关。让我看看现有代码结构。\n\n当前 is_trading_allowed 的逻辑：\n1. 清除 paused_until 和 consecutive_losses（老公 2026-03-31 指示）\n2. 检查 paused_until\n3. 检查日亏损\n\n最简单的方式：在 is_trading_allowed 开头直接返回 True。\n\n或者加一个配置开关。\n\n老公说\"熔断打开等他进\" - 意思是打开熔断让它交易，即解除熔断让系统进仓。\"稳定之后再打开熔断\" - 以后稳定了再启用。\n\n让我把 is_trading_allowed 改为直接返回 True。这样 monitor 就会正常开仓了。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_fGiLS1x2bhuSIq1zzkdZ8952","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","offset":855,"limit":20}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":409,"output":673,"cacheRead":70272,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":71354,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780811441053}}
{"type":"message","id":"5bbe0a42","parentId":"25a51122","timestamp":"2026-06-07T05:50:49.539Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_fGiLS1x2bhuSIq1zzkdZ8952","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"    def is_trading_allowed(self) -> tuple[bool, str]:\n        # 2026-03-31 22:07 老公指示：清除熔断\n        self.paused_until = None\n        self.consecutive_losses = 0\n        # 检查暂停\n        if self.paused_until and datetime.now() < self.paused_until:\n            remain = int((self.paused_until - datetime.now()).total_seconds() / 60)\n            return False, f\"熔断中，还需 {remain} 分钟\"\n\n        # 检查日亏损\n        loss_pct = self.daily_pnl / CONFIG[\"total_capital\"]\n        if loss_pct < CONFIG[\"circuit_breaker_pct\"]:\n            self.paused_until = datetime.now() + timedelta(hours=CONFIG[\"circuit_breaker_hours\"])\n            msg = f\"⚠️ 熔断！日亏损 {loss_pct:.1%}，暂停 {CONFIG['circuit_breaker_hours']} 小时\"\n            log.warning(msg)\n            write_alert(msg)\n            return False, msg\n\n        return True, \"ok\"\n\n\n[1915 more lines in file. Use offset=875 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780811449524}}
