{"type":"message","id":"d8c558d2","parentId":"8bacf69d","timestamp":"2026-06-07T06:03:54.998Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, news is fresh (6 seconds ago). Let me summarize:\n\n1. BTC/ETH 或迎 FTX 以来最惨周跌，加密市场蒸发 3900 亿美元 ⚪\n2. Meta 用稳定币支付创作者，但消费问题未解决 ⚪\n3. 🔴 美国大银行自建数字货币网络对抗存款流失\n4. 加密先驱将 2000 万变 10 亿基金，继续加仓 BTC ⚪\n5. 中本聪时代 BTC 涉及 2850 亿美元诉讼，14年后首次移动 ⚪\n\nOverall: neutral to slightly bearish. The big one is item 1 - worst weekly rout since FTX, $390B wiped out. That explains today's bloodbath.\n\nLet me keep it brief. Also, the news_fetcher bug was fixed (added `import os` and `str()` conversions for PosixPath).","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"刷新好了，6 秒前的新闻：\n\n1. BTC/ETH 或迎 FTX 以来最惨周跌，加密市场蒸发 3900 亿美元\n2. Meta 用稳定币支付创作者，花了再说\n3. 🔴 美国大银行自建数字支付网络对抗存款流失\n4. 加密先驱 2000 万变 10 亿基金，继续加仓 BTC\n5. 中本聪时代 BTC 牵涉 2850 亿诉讼，14 年后动了\n\n整体偏空，3900 亿蒸发是这轮跌的血亏总结。费了点劲——新闻抓取脚本有个 Path 拼接 bug，顺手修了。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":555,"output":542,"cacheRead":79232,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":80329,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780812226045}}
